     1	"""ATEN-only GEMM A/B driver (run statement run-statements/aten-gemm-ab.md).
     2	
     3	Runs every stage in a fresh subprocess on GPU 0, in the fixed order below,
     4	with a hard aggregate deadline. Stops at the FIRST failure of an ATEN-only
     5	correctness stage or of a timing stage. The default-backend control stages
     6	(expected to corrupt or fault) run last, each in its own subprocess; their
     7	outcome is recorded as reproduced / not reproduced and never stops the driver.
     8	
     9	Exit codes: 0 all stages ran and every non-control stage passed; 3 a
    10	non-control stage failed (driver stopped there); 4 the budget ran out.
    11	"""
